      * =================================================================== *
      *   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                                  *
      *     >>CRTCMD<<  CRTLF         FILE(&LI/&OB) +                       *
      *                               SRCFILE(&SL/&SF) SRCMBR(&SM);         *
      *     >>IMPORTANT<<                                                   *
      *       >>PARM<<                MBR(*NONE);                           *
      *       >>PARM<<                MAXMBRS(10);                          *
      *     >>END-IMPORTANT<<                                               *
      *     >>EXECUTE<<                                                     *
      *     >>CMD<<     ADDLFM FILE(&LI/&OB) MBR(Y2017) +                   *
      *                        DTAMBRS((&LI/HORDER    (Y2017))  +           *
      *                                (&LI/HITEM     (Y2017))  +           *
      *                                (&LI/HCUSTOMER (Y2017))) +           *
      *                        TEXT('Order history of 2017');               *
      *     >>CMD<<     ADDLFM FILE(&LI/&OB) MBR(Y2018) +                   *
      *                        DTAMBRS((&LI/HORDER    (Y2018))  +           *
      *                                (&LI/HITEM     (Y2018))  +           *
      *                                (&LI/HCUSTOMER (Y2018))) +           *
      *                        TEXT('Order history of 2018');               *
      *   >>END-PRE-COMPILER<<                                              *
      * =================================================================== *
     A          R FHSTQRY                   TEXT('History query file')
     A                                      JFILE(HORDER HITEM HCUSTOMER)
     A          J                           JOIN(HORDER HITEM)
     A                                      JFLD(ORDNBR ORDNBR)
     A          J                           JOIN(HORDER HCUSTOMER)
     A                                      JFLD(CUSTNBR CUSTNBR)
      *
     A            ORDNBR                    JREF(1)
     A            CUSTNBR                   JREF(3)
     A            COMMENTS
     A            ORDCRTD
     A            ORDCRTT
      *
     A            NAME
     A            STREET
     A            ZIPCODE
     A            CITY
     A            COUNTRY
      *
     A            ITMSQN
     A            ITMNBR
     A            PRICE
     A            QTYORD
      *
     A          K ORDNBR
      *
